# Read by set-wireless-regdom (wireless-regdb), which the cfg80211 udev
# rule runs when the module loads. Matches the default locale de_DE in
# locale.conf. /etc/conf.d/wireless-regdom is symlinked here by
# tmpfiles.d/etc.conf, replace the symlink with a real file to change
# it.
WIRELESS_REGDOM="DE"
